ags":[{"id":"N1","sev":"info","title":"49ers Week 18 at Arizona: date and time TBD","detail":"49ers.com lists Week 18 at the Cardinals as TBD. NFL.com says Week 18 is January 9-10, 2027. The planner marks both days busy (estimate).","links":["https://www.49ers.com/schedule/","https://www.nfl.com/news/2026-27-national-football-league-important-dates"]},{"id":"N2","sev":"review","title":"Non-national NFL Sunday games: per-game times not loaded","detail":"NFL.com schedule pages are rendered by JavaScript and returned no game data to the fetcher. Sunday afternoon regional games (Nov 29 - Jan 10) are shown as an estimated 10:00 AM - 4:35 PM PT block. Every national radio game (Westwood One) and every 49ers game uses official times.","links":["https://www.nfl.com/schedules/2026/REG13/","https://www.nfl.com/news/2026-27-national-football-league-important-dates"]},{"id":"C1","sev":"info","title":"Stanford bowl game possible (TBD)","detail":"Stanford is 6-5 before its Nov 28 game. A bowl game (mid-December to early January) is possible and is not on any official schedule yet. Days Dec 7, 2026 - Jan 25, 2027 are therefore not certified free for college football until bowl/CFP selections (Dec 6) are checked.","links":["https://gostanford.com/sports/football/schedule","https://collegefootballplayoff.com/sports/2018/8/31/cfp-games-schedule"]},{"id":"X1","sev":"review","title":"Stanford men's basketball radio station not verified for 2026-27","detail":"GoStanford.com lists games and TV but the fetched page shows no radio station. Older Stanford pages name KNBR 1050; not confirmed for this season. Games are shown, radio is blank.","links":["https://gostanford.com/sports/mens-basketball/schedule"]},{"id":"X2","sev":"review","title":"Warriors schedule after Dec 27, 2026 not loaded","detail":"NBA.com and the official NBA CDN return HTTP 403 to automated requests (GitHub runner). 13 games through Dec 27 were read from NBA.com's own schedule page as captured by a search index. Later games must be checked at nba.com/warriors/schedule.","links":["https://www.nba.com/team/1610612744/schedule"]},{"id":"N3","sev":"review","title":"Super Bowl LXIII date is not on an official page","detail":"Allegiant Stadium and NFL.com confirm Las Vegas as host but show the date as TBA. The planner uses Sunday, February 11, 2029 (18-week season pattern) as an estimate.","links":["https://www.allegiantstadium.com/events/detail/super-bowl-lxiii"]},{"id":"M1","sev":"review","title":"MLB 2028 and 2029 schedules not released; 2027 postseason dates not published","detail":"The MLB Stats API returns 0 games for 2028 and 2029 and no 2027 postseason games. The planner uses estimated blocks: Spring Training from Feb 18, 2028 / Feb 16, 2029, regular season to Oct 1, 2028 / Sep 30, 2029, postseason to early November. MLB has proposed a 154-game season from 2029 (a bargaining proposal, not adopted).","links":["https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/schedule?sportId=1&startDate=2028-01-01&endDate=2028-12-31"]},{"id":"M2","sev":"review","title":"MLB labor agreement expires Dec 1, 2026","detail":"The 2027 schedule was published pending a new collective bargaining agreement. A lockout could delay Spring Training (Feb 19) or Opening Day (Mar 24/25). That would add free time but cannot be planned on.","links":["https://www.mlb.com/press-release/press-release-mlb-announces-2027-spring-training-schedule"]},{"id":"M3","sev":"info","title":"MLB TBD start times use planner estimates","detail":"Many 2027 games (including most Giants home games) are 'start time TBD' in the official feed. The planner estimates 7:05 PM (weekday) or 1:10 PM (weekend) in the venue's time zone, 1:05 PM for Spring Training. These rows are marked EST TIME.","links":["https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/schedule?sportId=1&startDate=2027-01-01&endDate=2027-12-31"]},{"id":"R1","sev":"review","title":"A's Bay Area radio: KNEW 960 vs game-level data","detail":"MLB.com's Athletics affiliates page lists 960 AM KNEW for the Bay Area, but the official MLB game feed for the last 2026 series lists only Talk 650 KSTE (English), KVMX (Spanish) and A's Cast. Whether every A's game airs on KNEW 960 in San Francisco is not confirmed.","links":["https://www.mlb.com/athletics/schedule/affiliates","https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/schedule?sportId=1&teamId=133&startDate=2026-09-25&endDate=2026-09-27&hydrate=broadcasts(all)"]},{"id":"R2","sev":"review","title":"Reception in the Outer Sunset (94122) not field-tested","detail":"No station's signal strength at 94122 was measured. KNBR-FM and most FM stations transmit from Sutro Tower or San Bruno Mountain; AM reception indoors varies. Treat 'receivable' as unverified.","links":["https://www.westwoodonesports.com/station-finder/"]},{"id":"R3","sev":"info","title":"Westwood One station finder tables are labelled 2025","detail":"The station finder lists KNBR-AM, KNBR-FM, KNBR-F2 and KTCT-AM for San Francisco (NFL, NCAA football, NCAA basketball) and KTCT-AM for U.S. Soccer, but the tables are captioned '2025'. W1 also notes not every affiliate airs every broadcast (blackouts/conflicts).","links":["https://www.westwoodonesports.com/station-finder/"]},{"id":"Q1","sev":"info","title":"Prior reference sites did not load","detail":"The three earlier sites named in the brief (VacationSchedule, ScheduleFreeTime, RADIOSF on buffedlizard55-lab.github.io) returned errors to the fetch tool and their repositories are not public, so none of their data was reused.","links":["https://buffedlizard55-lab.github.io/VacationSchedule/site/","https://buffedlizard55-lab.github.io/ScheduleFreeTime/","https://buffedlizard55-lab.github.io/RADIOSF/"]},{"id":"Q2","sev":"review","title":"Other sessions' 2027 window omits the Feb 1-13 gap and calls 2027 Spring Training unreleased","detail":"data/windows_2026_2029.json (session b1591c47) gives the 2027 strict window as Feb 15-18 with an 'ESTIMATED' Spring Training start. MLB published the 2027 Spring Training schedule (Feb 19) and the NFL has no games between the Conference Championships (Jan 31) and the Super Bowl (Feb 14); the AFC-NFC Pro Bowl game is no longer staged. Under the brief's definition Feb 1-13, 2027 is free. That file belongs to another session and was not edited.","links":["https://www.mlb.com/press-release/press-release-mlb-announces-2027-spring-training-schedule","https://www.nfl.com/news/2026-27-national-football-league-important-dates","https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-elevates-pro-bowl-selection-game-s-will-cease-being-contested"]},{"id":"Q3","sev":"info","title":"Westwood One times vs NFL kickoff times (explains earlier flag F1)","detail":"Westwood One lists on-air times (e.g. TNF 7:30 PM ET, MNF 7:00 PM ET, SNF 7:30 PM ET) while NFL/team sites list kickoffs (8:15, 8:15, 8:20 PM ET). The gap matches the radio pregame. The planner treats the W1 time as the start of air time and the team-site kickoff (when known) for the game end.","links":["https://www.westwoodonesports.com/nfl-schedule/","https://www.49ers.com/schedule/"]}],"sources":{"mlb_api":{"url":"https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/schedule?sportId=1&startDate=2027-01-01&endDate=2027-12-31","label":"MLB Stats API schedule feed (official MLB data)","official":true,"note":""},"mlb_teams":{"url":"https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/teams?sportId=1","label":"MLB Stats API teams (30 clubs)","official":true,"note":""},"niners":{"url":"https://www.49ers.com/schedule/","label":"49ers.com official schedule (times PT, radio KSAN/KNBR)","official":true,"note":""},"w1_nfl":{"url":"https://www.westwoodonesports.com/nfl-schedule/","label":"Westwood One Sports NFL schedule (national radio; times ET = on-air)","official":true,"note":""},"nfl_dates":{"url":"https://www.nfl.com/news/2026-27-national-football-league-important-dates","label":"NFL.com 2026-27 important dates (official)","official":true,"note":""},"nfl_probowl":{"url":"https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-elevates-pro-bowl-selection-game-s-will-cease-being-contested","label":"NFL.com: AFC-NFC Pro Bowl 